        {
          "id": "Middle initial if any from Section 1-2",
          "label": "Supplement B, Re verification and Rehire (formerly Section 3). Employee Information from Section 1. Enter the Middle Initial (if any). Instructions: This supplement replaces Section 3 on the previous version of Form I-9. Only use this page if your employee requires reverification, is rehired within three years of the date the original Form I-9 was completed, or provides proof of a legal name change.  Enter the employee\u0027s name in the fields above. Use a new section for each reverification or rehire. Review the Form I-9 instructions before completing this page. Keep this page as part of the employee\u0027s Form I-9 record. Additional guidance can be found in the Handbood for Employers: Guidance for Completing Form I-9 (M-274) at  https://www.uscis.gov/i-9-central/form-i-9-resources/handbook-for-employers-m-274",
